I'm pretty new to nethack, I played for a while but got frustrated and
gave up.  I'm commited to beating this game this time, playing as an
orcish ranger.  My most recent death was to a soldier with a wand of
death, in "David's Treasure Zoo" on level 15 of the dungeon.  My basic
question is: was this death preventable by me, or just bad luck?  My
understanding is there are only 2 ways to stop a death ray: reflection
and magic resistance.  Here are, as I understand it, the possible ways
to obtain one of these, in rough order from most likely to least:
1) Guaranteed wand of wishing in the Castle
2) Guaranteed Longbow of Diana after quest
3) Sokoban (50% chance amulet)
4) Perseus (50% chance cursed shield in statue)
5) Magic lamp in mines or Izchak's shop (unlikely)
6) Random gray or silver dragon (very unlikely)
7) Random wand of wishing (extremely unlikely)

If I don't find a magic lamp in the mines or the amulet in Sokoban,
what can I do?  The castle and the quest are the only guaranteed
sources, but it seems like I'd need reflection or magic resistance to
get either!  My basic plan was to head to Medusa and hope for the
best, but I died on the way.  Is there a better strategy than what I'm
trying, or did I just get very unlucky?

